  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Ethical Recruitment and Fair Labour Practices in Panasonic Group Companies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with Panasonic Holdings Corporation, the project aims to promote ethical recruitment and fair labour practices in four migration corridors with Malaysia as the destination country and support businesses to respect, promote and remedy the human and labour rights of women and men migrant workers in international supply chains. These objectives are in line with the overall aim to promote the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights.</narrative>
  </description>
